--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.payroll_opening_balances.union_dues_ytd IS 'Eligible union dues already withheld this year before adoption (Canada). Folds into T4 box 44 and RL-1 box F with the committed stubs; zero when the prior provider reports none.';


