--

COMMENT ON TABLE public.hrm_payroll_inputs IS 'HRM pay-run input queue (0194): ONE ROW PER ABSENCE DAY for payout/bank_in types. HR sends HOURS only — there is deliberately NO amount column; the run resolves the rate. employee_party_id is the key the ledger reads; employment_id is provenance only and the two are never interchangeable. unique (org_id, source_leave_request_id, absence_date). Voiding never clears consumed_by_run_document_id (the only link back to the stale run).';


