--
-- Name: INDEX pay_components_org_system; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON INDEX public.pay_components_org_system IS 'Component identity (0189): one row per (org, country, system_key, kind). NULLS NOT DISTINCT keeps the org-level (NULL country) guarantee the three-column index gave; the partial predicate keeps NULL system_key user rows unconstrained, as before. Two packs may each own e.g. income_tax; the seeder absorbs reinstalls on this identity.';


