--
-- Name: INDEX stock_count_lines_no_duplicate_subject; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON INDEX public.stock_count_lines_no_duplicate_subject IS 'One line per (count, item, stock location, lot) subject for all unmarked rows. Duplicate subjects double-applied the variance before 0293; recounts re-snapshot the one line. Rows marked is_pre_guard_legacy predate the guard on an immutable count and are preserved as evidence (0293, provenance in 0326).';


